    "message": "Keep each pytest run's results under .test-results/\n\nA failed full run could not be traced afterwards: the names were only in\nthe long terminal output, and .pytest_cache forgets them on the next\npassing run (#136). tests/results_log.py, loaded from tests/conftest.py,\nwrites results.jsonl while the run goes and summary.txt with every\nfailure's traceback, captured output and the slowest tests when it ends,\nkeeps the newest 20 runs, and prints one line after pytest's summary\nwith the failed names and the summary path. Under pytest-xdist only the\ncontroller writes. tests/ is on pythonpath so conftest can load the\nplugin; docs/testing.md and CONTRIBUTING.md describe how to read the\nfiles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
